// Test: For loop with each...of prose syntax
// Spec: 02-SYNTAX.md § 4.3 For Loops
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate that `each x of range` works as prose alternative to `∀ x ∈ range`.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print 0, 1, 2

rite main() {
    each i of 0..3 {
        println(i);
    }
}
